  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance with our Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set, featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics for a cozy, timeless look. This quilt set is perfect for adding warmth and tradition to any bedroom, offering personalization options to make it uniquely yours or a thoughtful gift.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Farmhouse Design:</strong> Features classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a charming, timeless aesthetic.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Options:</strong> Customize with your preferred size, add pillowcases, or include a name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available in Multiple Sizes:</strong> Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), or King (102\"x91\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift Idea:</strong> An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for family members and loved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and can be air-dried for quick and easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes with one quilt, with the option to add two pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from durable and soft polycotton microfiber for comfort.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Sea Turtle Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>5 sizes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
